  "notes": "The county party bylaws filed with the Fayette County Election Bureau allow each precinct to elect up to two committee members every four years at the gubernatorial primary, including 2026; vacancies may later be filled by appointment. The 77 mapped precincts imply a ceiling of 154 positions, not a fixed authorized seat count. A complete certified 2026 committee result or current roster was not obtained, so the number and status of actual positions remain unverified and no seats are counted. The county result site blocked automated access when checked November 24, 2026."
